  "notes": "Warm paper/cream palette with editorial serif (Fraunces) headings over mono file names gives a cartographic, atlas-like character to a codebase explorer. Map regions are soft tinted blobs (green Node.js SMS worker, peach TypeScript donor app, grey Python Dispatch API) with dashed borders; folders are smaller blob islands; dots sized by lines and coloured by coverage bucket (red to teal). The selected path is drawn in thick black with numbered black circle markers; blast-radius dependents use amber rings and amber edges; dependencies use dashed lines. Issue numbers are dark-outlined tags with pointer tails pinned to nodes. Copy is unusually humane ('Untouched for a long while', 'Copy a question for Marco'). Map background appears to have a faint dot-grid texture. Legend click shows a dark dismissible chip 'Highlighting Under 20% · 16 modules'."
